                    'automation' => ['id' => 'otomatisasi', 'pos' => '(n)'],
                    'investment' => ['id' => 'investasi', 'pos' => '(n)'],
                    'collaboration' => ['id' => 'kolaborasi', 'pos' => '(n)'],
                ]
            ],
            2 => [ // Reducing
                'Menghadapi tekanan ekonomi global, pemerintah memutuskan untuk merevisi kebijakan fiskalnya. Diharapkan dapat merangsang investasi asing, undang-undang baru tersebut memotong tarif pajak perusahaan. Perusahaan yang beroperasi di sektor energi terbarukan akan menerima insentif tambahan. Berfokus pada pembangunan infrastruktur, anggaran negara telah dialokasikan secara besar-besaran untuk proyek jalan tol dan pelabuhan. Meskipun dikritik oleh beberapa pengamat ekonomi, langkah-langkah ini diprediksi akan mempercepat pemulihan ekonomi nasional.',
                'en' => 'Facing global economic pressure, the government decided to revise its fiscal policy. Expected to stimulate foreign investment, the new law cuts corporate tax rates. Companies operating in the renewable energy sector will receive additional incentives. Focusing on infrastructure development, the state budget has been heavily allocated to toll road and port projects. Despite being criticized by some economic observers, these measures are predicted to accelerate the national economic recovery.',
                'vocab' => [
                    'Facing' => ['id' => 'Menghadapi', 'pos' => '(v-ing)'],
                    'Expected' => ['id' => 'Diharapkan', 'pos' => '(v3)'],
                    'operating' => ['id' => 'yang beroperasi', 'pos' => '(v-ing)'],
                    'Focusing' => ['id' => 'Berfokus pada', 'pos' => '(v-ing)'],
                    'Despite being criticized' => ['id' => 'Meskipun dikritik', 'pos' => '(phrase)'],
                ]
            ],
            3 => [ // Abridgement
                'Proyek penelitian ini tidak hanya bertujuan untuk mengeksplorasi sumber energi alternatif, tetapi juga untuk mengurangi emisi karbon secara signifikan. Para ilmuwan mengusulkan desain turbin angin yang lebih ringan, lebih kuat, dan lebih tahan lama. Jika diimplementasikan dalam skala besar, teknologi inovatif ini dapat menurunkan biaya listrik dan menciptakan ribuan lapangan kerja baru. Banyak negara maju telah menyatakan ketertarikannya, dan beberapa negara berkembang mulai mempertimbangkan opsi serupa. Namun, pendanaan awal tetap menjadi tantangan utama, menghambat adopsi massal teknologi ini.',
                'en' => 'This research project aims not only to explore alternative energy sources but also to significantly reduce carbon emissions. Scientists proposed a wind turbine design that is lighter, stronger, and more durable. If implemented on a large scale, this innovative technology could lower electricity costs and create thousands of new jobs. Many developed countries have expressed interest, and several developing countries are beginning to consider similar options. However, initial funding remains a major challenge, hindering the mass adoption of this technology.',
                'vocab' => [
