                    'leaked' => ['id' => 'yang bocor', 'pos' => '(v3)'],
                    'implemented' => ['id' => 'yang diterapkan', 'pos' => '(v3)'],
                ]
            ],
            5 => [ // Inversion
                'Sama sekali tidak para direktur menyadari bahwa perusahaan berada di ambang kebangkrutan. Hanya setelah laporan keuangan tahunan diterbitkan, kebenaran tentang utang besar itu terungkap. Jarang sekali industri pasar saham mengalami volatilitas yang begitu ekstrem dalam waktu singkat. Baru saja CEO mengumumkan pengunduran dirinya ketika nilai saham anjlok tajam. Tidak hanya manajemen gagal mengantisipasi krisis, tetapi mereka juga menyembunyikan informasi dari para pemegang saham.',
                'en' => 'Little did the directors realize that the company was on the verge of bankruptcy. Only after the annual financial report was published was the truth about the massive debt revealed. Seldom does the stock market industry experience such extreme volatility in a short time. Hardly had the CEO announced his resignation when the stock value plummeted sharply. Not only did the management fail to anticipate the crisis, but they also hid information from the shareholders.',
                'vocab' => [
